  <content>
    <procedure>
      <preliminaryRqmts/>
      <mainProcedure>
        <proceduralStep><para>Make sure the mounting interface, air ducts and feeder cables are clean and serviceable.</para></proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep><para>Install the two-stage centrifugal compressor and torque the attachment bolts.</para></proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep><para>Connect the inlet and outlet air ducts and the three-phase feeder cables from the remote motor controller to the motor terminal box.</para></proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep><para>Install the ram-air cooling shroud on the motor housing.</para></proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep><para>Restore the 540 V DC supply, do an operational test up to maximum continuous speed (45 000 rpm) and return the aircraft to its initial configuration.</para></proceduralStep>
      </mainProcedure>
      <closeRqmts/>
    </procedure>
